Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Scenario: 323 Columns Layouttpl Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|layouttpl.plugins.includes|3-2-3-columns-layouttpl|
	When these variables
		|appName|3-2-3 Columns Layout|
	And these variables
		|portletName|3-2-3-columns-layouttpl|
	Then OSGiSmoke Smoke
		|appName|${portletName}|
		|portletName|${portletName}|